  "description": "YoloDotNet is a blazing-fast, modern C# library for real-time object detection, classification, segmentation, OBB, pose estimation — and tracking. Powered by ONNX Runtime, CUDA acceleration, and now NVIDIA TensorRT, it effortlessly handles images and video streams with ultra-low latency. Supports a wide range of cutting-edge models including YOLOv5u, YOLOv8, YOLOv9, YOLOv10, YOLOv11, YOLOv12, Yolo-World, and YOLO-E. Whether you’re building smart cameras, analytics dashboards, or unlocking real-time machine vision, YoloDotNet has you covered.",
